title: privacy
pid: 6cdb1dfa-e093-472a-b395-9820fb625115
body: |2-
  If a restricted export would include overPrivateText telescope text, Skg asks for
  approval for each such ID before writing any file. An export of the
  most private skgrepo (no skgrepo restriction) includes it with a warning. The noninteractive form "fails closed" (fails before writing any files) unless passed
  =--include-overPrivateText-telescopes=:

  : cargo run --bin skg -- export-org [config-path] [skgrepo-restriction] [output-dir] [--include-overPrivateText-telescopes]
